OL,3,GNEWSAHow helping European eels complete
OL,4,Aepic journey could save species
OL,5,
OL,6,FActivists say for the eels, it is
OL,7,Fcrucial more action is taken to improve
OL,8,Ftheir journey routes to save them from
OL,9,Fextinction.
OL,11,FOne group, based in the West of
OL,12,FEngland, is also hoping to boost
OL,13,Fpeople's knowledge of the creature in a
OL,14,Fbid to reverse its decline.
